### S3 *Frozen ruins, midwinter*
[BATTLE]
[Scenario: The Library | Find and retrieve 4 treasure tokens | unlimited turns | Snow: -1 Move]
[Unit: Rival Warband|x6|Morale 6| Fresh|north edge]

